626	/**
627	 * WHOIS lookup — raw TCP (port 43) WHOIS client with IANA referral following.
628	 *
629	 * We query whois.iana.org first, read the "refer:" / "whois:" server for the TLD,
630	 * then re-query that authoritative server. No third-party API, no dependency.
631	 * The WHOIS servers we connect to are a fixed allowlist (IANA + the referred host,
632	 * itself validated as a public hostname), timeouts ≤5s, output capped.
633	 */
